@startuml Sprint1_Authentication_Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

title Sprint 1: Authentication Process - MVC Sequence

actor User
participant "LoginComponent\n(View)" as View
participant "AuthController\n(Controller)" as Controller
database "HRUser Table\n(Model)" as Model

== **Authentication Flow** ==

User -> View: Submit login form\n(email, password)
activate View

View -> Controller: POST /api/auth/local\n{identifier, password}
activate Controller

Controller -> Model: Query HRUser table\nWHERE email = identifier
activate Model

alt User found & password valid
    Model -> Controller: {id, email, username}
    Controller -> Controller: Generate JWT token\n(sign with secret key)
    Controller -> View: HTTP 200\n{jwt: token, user: {...}}
    
else Invalid credentials
    Model -> Controller: No match
    Controller -> View: HTTP 401 Unauthorized\n{error: "Invalid email or password"}
    View -> User: Show error message
    stop
end

deactivate Model
deactivate Controller

View -> View: Store token in localStorage\nlocalStorage.setItem('token', jwt)
View -> View: Store user data in localStorage\nlocalStorage.setItem('user', JSON.stringify(user))
View -> User: Redirect to /dashboard
deactivate View

@enduml
